{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLWeights","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLWeights","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLIntertwine"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jimbo_mem_hwSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jimbo_mem_hwSpace","kind":"theorem","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L226-L233","doc":"**`ρ(H)` preserves every highest-weight space**: each `hwSpace μ` is an `H_{m+1}(q)`-module. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.hwSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.hwSpace","kind":"def","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L216-L224","doc":"**The highest-weight space** `V_μ ∩ ⋂_i ker E_i` of `(K^d)^{⊗(m+1)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jimbo_commute_weightProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.jimbo_commute_weightProj","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L210-L214","doc":"**Every `ρ(x)` preserves every weight space.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_weightProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_weightProj","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L205-L208","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj_mul_raiseOp_mul_weightProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj_mul_raiseOp_mul_weightProj","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L181-L197","doc":"**`E_i` maps `V_μ` into `V_{μ+α_i}`**: `P_ν E_i P_μ = 0` unless `ν(j) = μ(j) + 1`,\n`ν(i) + 1 = μ(i)` and `ν = μ` off `{i, j}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content_of_raiseOp_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content_of_raiseOp_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L144-L179","doc":"**`E_i` shifts content by `α_i`.**  A nonzero entry `E_i(a, b)` changes one letter `i` of `b`\ninto `j = i + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_mul_weightProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_mul_weightProj","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L126-L136","doc":"**The Cartan element `cartan c` acts on `V_μ` by `∏_x c(x)^{μ(x)}`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_weightProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_weightProj","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L118-L124","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj_mul_weightProj_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj_mul_weightProj_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L111-L116","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj_mul_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj_mul_self","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L106-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.weightProj","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L102-L104","doc":"The projector onto the weight space `V_μ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content_eq_of_embedPair_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content_eq_of_embedPair_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L71-L94","doc":"**`Ř` preserves content**: a nonzero entry of `Ř` at sites `i, j` joins two words with the\nsame content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.prod_eq_prod_pow_content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.prod_eq_prod_pow_content","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L63-L69","doc":"A product weight is a function of the content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content_eq_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content_eq_sum","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L59-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.content","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLWeights.lean#L56-L57","doc":"The weight (content) of a basis word: how many sites carry each letter. ","signatureChunk":0}]}